  {
   "id": "the-trolley-solution-345954@post-2026-04-30",
   "gameId": "the-trolley-solution-345954",
   "displayName": "Whoops!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-30T15:53:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hi, philosophical dilemmas and love stories involving transportation and schoolgirls aficionados!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As you might already know, the new DLC for The Trolley Solution, “My Torori-sama Romance: Nemesis of Steel” was released a few days ago.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you’re playing in English, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, or any language that uses the Latin alphabet, you probably didn’t experience any issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "...However, players using other languages may have noticed that all the dialogue appeared like this: “□□□□”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I’m really sorry about that. The game includes a script that detects the selected language and automatically sets the correct font—but I forgot to enable it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The issue has now been fixed! Players all over the world who use non-Latin alphabets can now enjoy “My Torori-sama Romance: Nemesis of Steel” in their own languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4389630/The_Trolley_Solution__Mai_Torori_Sama_Romansu_Nemesis_of_Steel/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your support and patience. I’ll do my best not to make a mistake like this again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "—Dan and Peterson",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
